SCOPE
-----

This repository is a modification of the NvFBC sample from the NVIDIA Capture
SDK, so it contains material from more than one source. The MIT license below
applies ONLY to the following paths:

    samples/NvFBC/NvFBCR/        (except NvFBCR.cpp, see below)
    samples/NvFBC/NvFBCEnable/
    samples/Common/
    docs/
    .github/
    README.md

samples/NvFBC/NvFBCR/NvFBCR.cpp is EXCLUDED. It still contains code from the
original NvFBC-Relay by Collin Blakley:

    https://gitlab.com/DonnerPartyOf1/nvfbc-relay

That project was published without a license, so it carries no grant and its
author retains all rights to his contributions. This file comes under the MIT
license below if and when he agrees to it.

Everything else is third-party material and stays under its own terms. That
includes the NvFBC headers in inc/NvFBC/, the SDK sample helpers in
samples/Util/, the NvAPI submodule at inc/NvAPI, and the prebuilt libraries in
lib/. See THIRD-PARTY.md for the full inventory.

Nothing in this file grants any rights to that third-party material.


